  "sangamTamil": "கருங்கொள்ளும் செங்கொள்ளும் தூணிப் பதக்கென்று\nஒருங்கொப்பக் கொண்டானாம் ஊரன் - ஒருங்கொவ்வா\nநன்னுதலார்த் தோய்ந்த வரைமார்பன் நீராடாது\nஎன்னையும் தோய வரும்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The injured wife to her confidante: 'The lord of the town has bought, it seems, black gram and red gram, a tuni and a pathakku, as if they were all the same! He, whose chest is broad as a mountain, having associated with the beautiful browed ones , — inferior to me! — unpurified, seeks my society too!'",
